%% Every active stage owns a form from its pinned immutable template version.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Accepted: Start booked, assigned workflow
  state "0 Job Accepted" as Accepted
  state "1 Travel / Arrival" as Travel
  state "2 Initial Inspection" as Inspection
  state "3 Diagnosis" as Diagnosis
  state "4 Repair / Service" as Repair
  state "5 Quality Verification" as Quality
  state "6 Customer Confirmation" as Customer
  state "7 Job Completion" as Completion
  Accepted --> Accepted: Request Reassignment rejected; assistance path
  Accepted --> Travel: Valid current-stage submission
  Travel --> Inspection: Valid submission
  Inspection --> Diagnosis: Valid submission
  Diagnosis --> Repair: Valid submission
  Repair --> Quality: Valid submission
  Quality --> Customer: Valid submission
  Customer --> Completion: Valid submission
  Completion --> Done: Valid final submission
  state "Completed workflow" as Done
  Done --> [*]
  note right of Diagnosis
    Each transition checks expected version.
    Idempotency receipt protects identical retries.
    Completed history stays read only.
  end note
  note right of Repair
    Supervisor pause and resume keep the same stage.
    Reasoned override advances one non-final stage.
    Assistance does not stop the SLA clock.
  end note

